  "question": {
    "text": "In two similar wires of tension <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> and <math><mi>T</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> beats are heard, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>"
